00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:06.160
Number six, the dry erase board with everyone's weight loss stats.
第六，写着每个人减肥数据的白板。

344
00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.720
Number seven, the fruit flies.
第七，果蝇。

345
00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.560
And number eight, the rotting of fruit.
第八，水果腐烂。

346
00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:12.940
Wow.
哇。

347
00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.320
That's what they were keeping track of.
这就是他们一直在追踪的内容。

348
00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:17.040
So many things.
有这么多的事情。

349
00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:23.500
