1174
00:47:07.370 --> 00:47:07.790
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1175
00:47:08.310 --> 00:47:13.130
Jan enters the office and tells Ronnie to make her some copies of a document on canary yellow paper.
简走进办公室，让罗妮把一份文件用金丝雀黄色的纸复印几份。

1176
00:47:13.350 --> 00:47:13.710
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1177
00:47:13.750 --> 00:47:15.190
She walks in like she owns the place.
她大摇大摆地走进来，好像这里是她家开的一样。

1178
00:47:15.330 --> 00:47:18.750
